---
layout: base.njk
title: 洞察
permalink: /insights/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<h1>洞察</h1>

<p class="lead">从各种来源收集的技术洞察、行业分析和深度观察。这里保留最近 30 条，其余进入归档。</p>

<div class="posts">
    {% for post in collections.insights | reverse %}
    {% if loop.index <= 30 %}
    <article class="post">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-link">
            <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date | dateFormat }}</p>
            <h2 class="post-title">{{ post | displayTitle }}</h2>
        </a>
    </article>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
</div>

<p class="more-link"><a href="/insights/archive/">查看全部洞察归档 →</a></p>
